# The Vercel deploy is the Python engine + agent (src/) plus the
# already-built frontend/dist static demo. None of the following are
# needed at deploy time and together they bloat the upload past what
# `vercel deploy` tolerates (repo is ~1.4GB with these included).
.venv
eve-agent
frontend/node_modules
frontend/src
frontend/public
data
docs
adk
scripts
.git
.cursor
.gemini
.code-review-graph
/*.html
